E vakatau ena ituvaki ni cakacaka .

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
E rawa ni o tokaruataka na iwalewale oqo ena vica vata na gauna, .

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Na levu ga ni nomu taura na nomu gauna mo dikeva vinaka, .

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Vakalailaitaka na veivakatovolei kei na cala ena gauna ni ituvatuva kei na kena vakayacori.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Yavutaki ena veitalanoa me yacova mai oqo .

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Eda sa tuvanaka na noda kasitama vakayagataki kisi ki na va na iwasewase:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Tarava na vakailesilesi .

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Na vakailesilesi e rawa ni raica ni tiko e lima na iyaya ni veiliutaki:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Vakaitaki au, au dau qaqarauni ena kena vakayagataki na vosa "Manage" ena veivakatorocaketaki.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Manage sa rui rabailevu e dua na ivakamacala

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
E sega ni matata na ka o cakava tiko

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
E vaka tale ga kina eke

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
E vakacava sara mada na kena qaravi?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Au sega ni kila

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Ena nomu vosa vei ira na kenadau ni vanua

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Na veika yadua ni veiliutaki sa vakarabailevutaki ki na dua na kisi ni vakayagataki vakatabakidua.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Kevaka e dua na cakacaka dina

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
E rairai levu cake na kisi ni vakayagataki mai na ka oqo.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Eke au sa vakarawarawataka me vakamacalataki.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Na ka e bibi mo kila eke ni gauna o bulia kina e dua na gauna ni cici, .

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
E rawa ni o raica ni sa buli talega na tikite .

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Na gauna e voli kina se vakasuka e dua na tikite .

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
E rawa talega ni o raica ni keitou vakayagataka e dua na veiqaravi e taudaku ka vakatokai na matamata ni sausaumi.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Au vakaduavatataka na kisi ni vakayagataki ni kasitama kei na manidia.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Raica na kisi ni vakayagataki taucoko me vaka oqo .

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
E dua na ka e vakila ni lala .

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
E tiko e dua na digidigi me vakuri kina e dua na vale ni sarasara .

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Au sega ni raica e dua na ka me vaka na Valenisarasara ni Vakasaqara .

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
E vaka me sa vica sara na kisi ni vakayagataki era sa biu laivi tiko.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Baleta mai na rai ni dua na kenadau ni domain, e levu sara na ka me vakamacalataki.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Na kisi ni vakayagataki oqo, ka vaka me matata sara,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
E rawa ni o biuta laivi na ivakamacala .

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Ia vakacava mai na nona rai e dua na dauvakatorocaketaka?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
E vinaka cake me biu laivi na kisi ni itukutuku rawarawa me vaka na vakasaqarai ni dua na vale ni sarasara.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Ena sega beka ni veivuke vakalevu cake oqo ena kena maroroi na ivola?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Kevaka e droini ni muri

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Na kisi ni vakayagataki rawarawa me vaka na vakasaqara e dua na vale ni sarasara .

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Au nanuma ni sega ni dua na leqa me skip kina

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Na ka au tukuna tiko oqo ni se bera ni bera na kena saumi ena gauna ni kena vakayacori.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Ia kevaka e dua na cakacaka dina .

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Vei ira na dau tuvatuva ni sikirini, na kisi ni vakayagataki oqo e dua na itekitekivu vinaka.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Na dau tuvatuva e raica na kisi ni vakayagataki ni vakasaqarai ni dua na vale ni sarasara.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Me rawa vakacava meu vakasaqara na veivale ni sarasara?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
O na rawa ni vakasamataka .

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Ni o cokovata na iyaloyalo me dua ga, e vaka me vereverea.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Kevaka e dua na cakacaka dina, ena dredre sara.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Ena ituvaki oqo, e sega ni gadrevi me vakasaurarataki e dua na merge.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Au sa qai vakaduavatataki ira eke me vakaraitaka ni tiko na kisi e yali.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Au vakacuruma kece na kisi e yali .

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Au sa dua na kisi ni vakayagataki na vanua e biu kina na veiwekani ki na dauqito.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Oqo e baleti rau ruarua na kasitama kei na manidia.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Ka me rawarawa na kena vakayacori, au vola ena vosa vakavavalagi.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Sa vinaka tu oqo baleta ni dua na cakacaka lailai

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Kevaka e levu ka vereverea na cakacaka .

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
E dodonu me tekivu vakamacala e vei e dua na kenadau ni domain?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Ena rairai dredre .

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Na cava e cakava e dua na dauniveiliutaki?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
E levu sara na cakacaka

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Me vaka e namaki mai vua na manidia .

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Ena ituvaki oqo, e rawa beka ni da wasei ira na dauqito?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
E dua talega na vakasama vinaka me railesuva .

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Taumada au a vakatokai meu dua na dauniveiliutaki .

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
E rawa ni wasei vakalailai ena itavi .

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Na vakayagataki ni Sistema ni Buking ni iyaloyalo .

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
E rawa ni tiko na veiqaravi e tautuba .

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Kevaka eda wasea na dauqito me vaka oqo,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Na kenadau ni domain ena rawa ni vakarautaka e levu cake na itukutuku vakailawalawa.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
E dina, oqo e dua ga na ivakaraitaki ni kena dikevi e dua na vanua vereverea.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
E rawa ni tiko eso tale na sala vinaka .

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
E bibi me veisautaki na nomu isaunitaro me vakatau ena ituvaki.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Oqo na kena itinitini .

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Ena gauna oqo, eda na vakayagataka e dua na iyaloyalo ni kisi ni vakayagataki .

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Tuvanaka na takete me baleta na cakacaka

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Au sa lako curuma oti na itekivu ni veivakatarogi.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Vakatamata, ena gauna taucoko ni veivakatorocaketaki .

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Au nanuma ni vakadidike e dredre duadua

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Baleta ni dodonu me da tuvanaka na vakasama vakaitamera duadua ka sega ni matata.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Ena gauna e tarava eda na raica na kisi ni vakayagataki levu .

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Meda dikeva mada vakavinaka .

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Vinaka vakalevu na nomuni cakacaka vakaukauwa me yacova mai oqo.

